      "message": "This script runs on the OPNFV lf-build static nodes, where the previous code deliberately special-cased pyenv 3.6.4 and `pip install --user`. Removing that is correct -- lftools-uv needs \u003e\u003d3.11 and 3.6.4 was never going to work -- but it does mean this path now depends on those nodes having a usable ~/lf-env.sh, and in the fallback branch on wget plus outbound access to raw.githubusercontent.com.\n\nWorth confirming before merge. The script runs with `set -u unset` and no `-e`, so a failure here will not abort cleanly; it will surface later as a confusing downstream error.",
